2	2025-03-27 20:44:15	2026-01-28 13:35:51	usgqm1d1wjuj7zj4	usgqm1d1wjuj7zj4	2	18118	{"id":18118,"name":"Graphics 111: Printed Mugs (Dye Sublimation Clearance)","code":null,"capacity":6,"archived":false,"description":"A description","startDate":"2026-02-15","startTime":"18:00:00","endDate":"2026-02-15","endTime":"20:00:00","publishEvent":true,"enableEventRegistrationForm":true,"addressLine1":"214 N Trenton Ave.","addressLine2":null,"addressLine3":null,"addressLine4":null,"addressType":"Other","addressCity":"Pittsburgh","addressZipCode":"15221","addressZipCodeSuffix":null,"addressCountry":null,"campaignCode":null,"campaignName":null,"fundCode":null,"fundName":null,"purposeCode":null,"purposeName":null,"thumbnailUrl":null}	\N	{"id":"18118","name":"Graphics 111: Printed Mugs (Dye Sublimation Clearance)","summary":"Graphics 111: Printed Mugs (Dye Sublimation Clearance)","code":null,"maximumAttendees":6,"category":{"id":"15","name":"Project-Based Workshop","status":null},"topic":null,"campaign":null,"publishEvent":true,"enableEventRegistrationForm":true,"archived":false,"enableWaitListing":false,"createAccountsforAttendees":true,"eventDescription":"<p><img height=\\"200\\" src=\\"https://d2r0txsugik6oi.cloudfront.net/neon/resource/protohaven/images/class_graphics111.jpg\\"/></p>\\n<p>Learn the simple and highly applicable process of dye sublimation printingwhile making your very own custom ceramic mug!\\nThis class will introduce you to some of the skills and methods used in graphic design and marketing to bring vibrant, full-color illustrations to life on a surprisingly wide range of surfaces: drinkware, clothing, architectural signage and more! Whether you’re already a member or choose to become one in the future, taking this class will gain you clearance to use our Dye Sublimation Printer independently.</p>\\n<p><strong>What you Will Create</strong></p>\\n<p>A custom mug of your own creation!</p>\\n\\n<p><strong>What to Bring/Wear</strong></p>\\n<p>N/A</p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Clearances Earned</strong></p>\\n<p>Dye sublimation printer &amp;Heat press</p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Age Requirement</strong></p>\\n<p>Open to ages 12+. Class participants that are 12-17 years old must have a parent present at Protohaven for the duration of the class. </p><p>All members, visitors,and class participants are expected to abide by Protohaven rules and guidelines outlined in the <a href=\\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Zgr-sqQiZ6Kf32SUrt1gD8vXS9QXz7T04IGVcownmUc/edit?usp=sharing\\">Member Guide</a>.</p><ul>\\n<li>Single-session class or workshop<ul>\\n<li>If canceled 72 hours or more before the scheduled date, the participant will have the option to receive a refund, or have their registration moved to another class or workshop.</li>\\n<li>If canceled within 72 hours of the scheduled date, no refund will be provided, but the participant may choose to have their registration moved to another class or workshop or to receive a credit on their account.</li>\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n<li>Multi-session class or workshop<ul>\\n<li>If canceled 1 week (7 days) prior to the start date, the participant will have the option to receive a refund or account credit minus a $35 cancellation fee, or to have their registration moved to another multi-session class or workshop, if available.</li>\\n<li>If canceled less than 1 week (7 days) prior to the start date, no refund will be provided, but the participant will receive a credit on their account, minus a $75 cancellation fee.  </li>\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>If a participant is a no-show, no refunds, credits, or transfers (rescheduling) will be given. Please be aware that there are no exceptions to these cancellation policies. <strong>Classes may be cancelled due to low enrollment.</strong></p>","eventDates":{"startDate":"2025-04-15","endDate":"2025-04-15","startTime":"06:00 PM","endTime":"08:00 PM","registrationOpenDate":"2025-03-05","registrationCloseDate":"2025-04-14","timeZone":{"id":"1","name":"Eastern Time - New Yo