1	2025-03-27 20:44:14	2026-08-13 19:11:05	usgqm1d1wjuj7zj4	usgqm1d1wjuj7zj4	1	18009	{"id":18009,"name":"Laser: Custom Wood Boxes (Rabbit Laser Clearance)","code":null,"capacity":6,"archived":false,"description":"<p><img src=\\"https://lipsum.app/random/1600x900\\"></img> Interested in using our large format lasers to create your own projects, but not sure where to start? In this class, students will create their own customized laser cut project, learning how to use common software tools and techniques to safely operate the Protohaven Large Format Laser.</p>\\\\n<p><strong>What you Will Create</strong></p>\\\\n<p>A custom laser cut wood box</p>\\\\n\\\\n<p><strong>What to Bring/Wear</strong></p>\\\\n<p>N/A</p>\\\\n\\\\n<p><strong>Clearances Earned</strong></p>\\\\n<p>Large format laser cutter</p>\\\\n\\\\n<p><strong>Age Requirement</strong></p>\\\\n<p>Open to ages 12+. Class participants that are 12-17 years old must have a parent present at Protohaven for the duration of the class.\\\\u00a0</p><p>All members, visitors, and class participants are expected to abide by Protohaven rules and guidelines outlined in the Member Guide.</p><ul>\\\\n<li>Single-session class or workshop<ul>\\\\n<li>If canceled 72 hours or more before the scheduled date, the participant will have the option to receive a refund, or have their registration moved to another class or workshop.</li>\\\\n<li>If canceled within 72 hours of the scheduled date, no refund will be provided, but the participant may choose to have their registration moved to another class or workshop or to receive a credit on their account.</li>\\\\n</ul>\\\\n</li>\\\\n<li>Multi-session class or workshop<ul>\\\\n<li>If canceled 1 week (7 days) prior to the start date, the participant will have the option to receive a refund or account credit minus a $35 cancellation fee, or to have their registration moved to another multi-session class or workshop, if available.</li>\\\\n<li>If canceled less than 1 week (7 days) prior to the start date, no refund will be provided, but the participant will receive a credit on their account, minus a $75 cancellation fee.\\\\u00a0\\\\u00a0</li>\\\\n</ul>\\\\n</li>\\\\n</ul>\\\\n<p>If a participant is a no-show, no refunds, credits, or transfers (rescheduling) will be given.\\\\u00a0Please be aware that there are no exceptions to these cancellation policies.\\\\u00a0<strong>Classes may be cancelled due to low enrollment.</strong></p>","startDate":"2026-08-30","startTime":"18:00:00","endDate":"2026-08-30","endTime":"21:00:00","publishEvent":true,"enableEventRegistrationForm":true,"addressLine1":"214 N Trenton Ave.","addressLine2":null,"addressLine3":null,"addressLine4":null,"addressType":"Other","addressCity":"Pittsburgh","addressZipCode":"15221","addressZipCodeSuffix":null,"addressCountry":null,"campaignCode":null,"campaignName":null,"fundCode":null,"fundName":null,"purposeCode":null,"purposeName":null,"thumbnailUrl":null}	\N	{"id":"18009","name":"Laser 114: Custom Wood Boxes (Rabbit Laser Clearance)","summary":"Laser 114: Custom Wood Boxes (Rabbit Laser Clearance)","code":null,"maximumAttendees":6,"category":{"id":"15","name":"Project-Based Workshop","status":null},"topic":null,"campaign":null,"publishEvent":true,"enableEventRegistrationForm":true,"archived":false,"enableWaitListing":false,"createAccountsforAttendees":true,"eventDescription":"<p>Interested in using our large format lasers to create your own projects, but not sure where to start? In this class, students will create their own customized laser cut project, learning how to use commonsoftware tools and techniques to safely operate the Protohaven Large Format Laser.</p>\\n<p><strong>What you Will Create</strong></p>\\n<p>A custom laser cut wood box</p>\\n\\n<p><strong>What to Bring/Wear</strong></p>\\n<p>N/A</p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Clearances Earned</strong></p>\\n<p>Large format laser cutter</p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Age Requirement</strong></p>\\n<p>Open to ages 12+. Class participants that are 12-17 years old must have a parent present at Protohaven for the duration of the class. </p><p>All members, visitors, and class participants are expected to abide by Protohaven rules and guidelines outlined in the <a href=\\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Zgr-sqQiZ6Kf32SUrt1gD8vXS9QXz7T04IGVcownmUc/edit?usp=sharing\\">Member Guide</a>.</p><ul>\\n<li>Single-session class or workshop<ul>\\n<li>If canceled 72 hours or more before the scheduled date, the participant will have the option to receive a refund, or have their registration moved to another class or workshop.</li>\\n<li>If canceled within 72 hours of the scheduled date, no refund will be provided, but the participant may choose to have their registration moved to another class orworkshop or to receive a credit on their account.</li>\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n<li>Multi-session class or workshop<ul>\\n<li>If canceled 1 week (7 days) prior to the start date, the participant will have the option to receive a refund or account credit minus a $35 cancellation fee, or to have their registration moved to another multi-session class or workshop, if available.</li>\\n<li>If canceled less than 1 week (7 days) prior to the start date, no refund will be provided, but the participant will receive a credit on their account, minus a $75 cancellation fee.  </li>\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>If a participant is a no-show, no refunds, credits, or transfers (rescheduling) will be given. Please be aware that there are no exceptions to these cancellation policies. <strong>Classes may be cancelled due to low enrollment.</strong></p>","eventDates":{"startDate":"2026-08-30","endDate":"2026-08-30","startTime":"06:00 PM","endTime":"09:00 PM","registrationOpenDate":"2026-07-30","registrationCloseDate":"2026-08-30","timeZone":{"id":"1","name":"Eastern Time - New York","status":null}},"financialSettings":{"feeType":"MT_OA","admissionFee":null,"ticketsPerRegistration":null,"fund":null,"taxDeductiblePortion":null,"donations":null},"location":{"name":