4	2025-03-19 15:44:31	\N	usgqm1d1wjuj7zj4	\N	1	rec0OtOTIvHm5xvnA	6c1b05efd5daeb83bf8af3c53b835d66908c7de9	Techs: New Closing Tasks for Graphics Area	Shop Tech	Hey Techs - on a recent shift, it was discovered that the vinyl cutter and heat press were left running for two days. There's now a new tech task to check and turn these machines off before closing up for the night. \n\nAll closing tasks can be found in the Shop Tech Central page of protohaven.org/wiki; please review the closing steps and familiarize yourself with them. Thanks!	2024-09-04	\N
