1	2025-03-19 15:44:31	\N	usgqm1d1wjuj7zj4	\N	3	rec5mviiH5kESaRwe	491c20e31a0982491678ae1ba896898a1a507a2a	Notice to laser cutter users	Member	We've had issues with someone cutting foam and/or laminate flooring and producing a lot of soot which may potentially be toxic. Our volunteer techs have had to clean the laser much more frequently due to the buildup. If you are cutting foam or laminate flooring, please talk to the tech on duty.	2024-08-22	\N
6	2025-03-19 15:44:31	\N	usgqm1d1wjuj7zj4	\N	4	rec9QmDuYtixopEBo	9a5b8d54a33ebf87cb16178c9b7c0dc49c2e75d8	New: "Do Not Disturb" slap bracelets! 	Shop Tech,Instructor,Member	It's fun to talk shop with other members - but sometimes work needs to be done. We've provided a container of slap bracelets at the front desk for members to use as an experiment over the next few weeks. If you see someone wearing a slap bracelet, they're trying to get work done. Please don't disturb their flow! 	2024-06-17	\N
7	2025-03-19 15:44:31	\N	usgqm1d1wjuj7zj4	\N	5	recGCCrtleJfInP6A	65c2e7ec6e536078fb6c0e8f046247f505490d5f	Member Appreciation Party - This Saturday	Member	Our member appreciation party is 3-7 p.m. on Saturday the 21st (this weekend!) The shop will be in look-only mode during that time -- please take a break from your project and enjoy the festivities!	2024-09-16	\N
