3	2025-03-19 15:44:31	\N	usgqm1d1wjuj7zj4	\N	10	recTmgOUoFY1gi8ES	3bc1586272047180eed7791cbdb0979c1d43686a	Notice to Wood Planer Users	Member	We recently discovered a severe buildup of sticky residue on the blades, infeed and outfeed rollers on the wood planer. This has taken the machine down for several days for maintenance. Please be cautious and ensure your materials are free of unset glue, uncured resin, or significant amounts of sap before using the planer on them. Thank you!	2024-11-07	\N
