r to receive a credit on their account.</li>\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n<li>Multi-session class or workshop<ul>\\n<li>If canceled 1 week (7 days) prior to the start date, the participant will have the option to receive a refund or account credit minus a $35 cancellation fee, or to have their registration moved to another multi-session class or workshop, if available.</li>\\n<li>If canceled less than 1 week (7 days) prior to the start date, no refund will be provided, but the participant will receive a credit on their account, minus a $75 cancellation fee.  </li>\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>If a participant is a no-show, no refunds, credits, or transfers (rescheduling) will be given. Please be aware that there are no exceptions to these cancellation policies. <strong>Classes may be cancelled due to low enrollment.</strong></p>","eventDates":{"startDate":"2025-03-17","endDate":"2025-03-17","startTime":"06:00 PM","endTime":"09:00 PM","registrationOpenDate":"2024-12-30","registrationCloseDate":"2025-03-16","timeZone":{"id":"1","name":"Eastern Time - New York","status":null}},"financialSettings":{"feeType":"MT_OA","admissionFee":null,"ticketsPerRegistration":null,"fund":null,"taxDeductiblePortion":null,"donations":null},"location":{"name":"Protohaven","roomNumber":null,"buildingNumber":null,"address":"214 N Trenton Ave. ","city":"Pittsburgh","stateProvince":{"code":"PA","name":"Pennsylvania","status":null},"country":null,"zipCode":"15221","zipCodeSuffix":null},"thumbnailUrl":null}},"column_meta":{"fetch_data":{"id":"cgeli1h3hawp1zd","title":"fetch_data","type":"JSON","options":{}}},"table_title":"events"}	usgqm1d1wjuj7zj4	\N	\N	\N	\N	Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64; rv:139.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/139.0	1	2025-06-05 13:32:21+00	2025-06-05 13:32:21+00
