li>Multi-session class or workshop<ul>\\n<li>If canceled 1 week (7 days) prior to the start date, the participant will have the option to receive a refund or account credit minus a $35 cancellation fee, or to have their registration moved to another multi-session class or workshop, if available.</li>\\n<li>If canceled less than 1 week (7 days) prior to the start date, no refund will be provided, but the participant will receive a credit on their account, minus a $75 cancellation fee.  </li>\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>If a participant is a no-show, no refunds, credits, or transfers (rescheduling) will be given. Please be aware that there are no exceptions to these cancellation policies. <strong>Classes may be cancelled due to low enrollment.</strong></p>","financialSettings":{"admissionFee":null,"feeType":"MT_OA","fund":null,"taxDeductiblePortion":null,"ticketsPerRegistration":null},"location":{"address":"214 N Trenton Ave.","city":"Pittsburgh","name":"Protohaven","stateProvince":{"name":"Pennsylvania"},"zipCode":"15221"},"maximumAttendees":4,"name":"Plastics 101: Shredder, Dryer, and Injection Molder Clearance","publishEvent":true,"summary":"Plastics 101: Shredder, Dryer, and Injection Molder Clearance"}},"column_meta":{"data":{"id":"csn24cjx48k0e6g","title":"data","type":"JSON","options":{}}},"table_title":"events"}	2025-05-16 14:14:47+00	2025-05-16 14:14:47+00	1	usgqm1d1wjuj7zj4	\N	\N	Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64; rv:137.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/137.0
